{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make choco bananas on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dip each banana in chocolate and add a topping, making choco bananas to order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aRules\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choco bananas to order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dip bananas in chocolate, decorate them with tasty toppings, and serve them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make as many as you can before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHow to Play\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Prepare a banana and skewer it on a stick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Dip the banana in chocolate! Choose from choco, matcha, strawberry and mint flavors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. When the chocolate has set, add a topping! Choose from sprinkles, sugar balls, and choco sauce!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. When the chocolate has hardened, serve the choco banana!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whip up as many choco bananas as possible and aim for the top spot on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others and test your choco banana-making skills!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832330?t=1753313016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832330?t=1753313016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832330/e3f3bf199cd8ba8229bd3cafa50de65efd7ddcc1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753313016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3